Package: rapidglm
Title: Fast and Numerically Stable Generalized Linear Model Fitting
Version: 1.4.1
Authors@R: person("Ling-Hong", "Hung", email = "lhhunghimself@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A fitting method for stats::glm() and a negative binomial fit
    returning MASS::glm.nb()-compatible objects, backed by the RapidGLM C++
    engine. Poisson (log), binomial (logit) and negative binomial (log) models
    are fitted natively; Gaussian and other families use stats::glm.fit().
    Bulk differential expression by the DESeq2 procedure (bulk_de()) and
    perturbation screen analysis by the SCEPTRE method (sceptre()) run through
    the RapidGLM C interface.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: stats, methods, MASS, Matrix
LinkingTo: cpp11
SystemRequirements: C++17, Boost headers
